      "body": "You raise a very important point Ryan, getting to a particular level not only depends on the company but also on the team and leadership of the organization. Though most of these \"Big Techs\" have a company wide job level expectations, how they are interpreted varies a lot between teams.\n\nAt Google, I've seen perf packets getting lots of feedback from one manager and full support from another. Sometimes even within the same org.",
